---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Eight34 Labs" description="Meet Tee Jay, founder of Eight34. How Eight34 grew from a web engineering studio into an AI consultancy for businesses." skyWash>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="hero-label">About</p>
      <h1>Eight34 Labs, <em>rebuilt around one goal.</em></h1>
      <p>Eight34 began as a web engineering studio — building websites and digital products. The craft is the same; the mission is now focused: bring practical AI to the local businesses that big tech overlooks.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Meet Tee Jay -->
    <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Founder</span>
          <h2>Meet Tee Jay</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-500); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 16px;">
          Tee Jay is the founder of Eight34, based in the New York City metropolitan area. His background is in building modern websites and digital products — the engineering discipline behind Eight34 Labs&rsquo; first chapter.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-500); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">
          Eight34 Labs is his consultancy for the next one: helping businesses everywhere find where AI genuinely saves money, and setting it up properly — no hype, no jargon, no overselling.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/teejay834/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">Tee Jay on LinkedIn ↗</a>
          <a class="btn-outline" href="/contact" style="padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 14px;">Work with Eight34 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Principles -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150);">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Principles</h2>
        <p>How Eight34 Labs decides things</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ruled-rows">
        <div class="ruled-row">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h3>Savings first, technology second</h3>
          <p>Every recommendation has to name the hours or dollars it gives back. A tool that can&rsquo;t do that — however impressive the demo — doesn&rsquo;t get recommended.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ruled-row">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h3>Honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</h3>
          <p>Some tasks should stay human, and some businesses are already lean. Saying so, even when it costs us a project, is how a local consultancy earns the next ten years of referrals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ruled-row">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h3>Your business stays yours</h3>
          <p>Your accounts, your data, your logins, documented in a guide your team can follow. If you ever stop working with us, everything keeps running without us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ruled-row">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <h3>Small steps, proven before scaled</h3>
          <p>One workflow working and paying off before the next begins. It&rsquo;s slower to sell and much better to own — which is the side of the table we sit on with you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-150); padding-bottom: 118px;">
      <div class="contact-cta-box">
        <h2>Start with a conversation.</h2>
        <p>Tell us where your week goes — we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly if AI can help.</p>
        <div class="contact-cta-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14.5px;">Contact Us →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
